hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2864","Muhammad ibn Yahya narrated to us, saying: Al-Nufayli narrated to us, saying: Hatim narrated to us, saying: Ja'far narrated to us, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Jabir (RA), who said: ""In the narration of Ja'far ibn Muhammad... then he followed the middle path which leads you to the Greater Jamrah until he came to the Jamrah which is near the tree."""
